Package: uzunyx-pager
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7), plasma-desktop-data, qml6-module-org-kde-taskmanager, qml6-module-org-kde-pipewire, qml6-module-org-kde-plasma-workspace, qml6-module-org-kde-plasma-plasma5support
Description: Virtual desktop pager for the Plasma panel, in the Uzunyx style
 Plasma widget (org.uzunyx.pager): a glass pill with a dot per virtual desktop
 and the current one in the edition's accent colour. It hides while there is
 only one desktop. Hovering a dot shows that desktop's windows live.
